    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμηρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>meet,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡμήρησε δέ μοι . . ἄγγελος ὠκύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					16.468
				</span></i>
			 ; expld. by <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i> as 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκολουθεῖν</span>
